.TH QUIPU-FLUENT 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-fluent \- Append fluent observations or read current values over authenticated HTTP
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu fluent\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Append fluent observations or read current values over authenticated HTTP
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quipu\-fluent\-append(1)
Append a JSON observation through the native fluent writer
.TP
quipu\-fluent\-current(1)
Read a fluent snapshot from its exact graph
.TP
quipu\-fluent\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
